      <title>安迪·奥格尔斯在田纳西州输给了共和党挑战者</title>
      <link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/08/06/us/politics/andy-ogles-loses-tennessee-primary-charlie-hatcher.html</link>
      <description><![CDATA[奥格尔斯曾担任两届国会议员，尽管存在争议，但他之前也曾阻止过主要威胁。但周四，前州农业专员查理·哈切尔(Charlie Hatcher)却表达了不满。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/08/06/us/politics/andy-ogles-loses-tennessee-primary-charlie-hatcher.html</guid>
      <pubDate>Fri, 07 Aug 2026 02:14:59 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>布莱克本赢得共和党田纳西州州长提名</title>
      <link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/08/06/us/elections/marsha-blackburn-tennessee-governor-primary.html</link>
      <description><![CDATA[参议员玛莎·布莱克本 (Marsha Blackburn) 轻松击败了两位共和党竞争对手，现在有望成为 11 月选举后该州第一位女州长。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/08/06/us/elections/marsha-blackburn-tennessee-governor-primary.html</guid>
      <pubDate>Fri, 07 Aug 2026 02:02:25 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>新墨西哥州法官责令 Meta 支付 5.67 亿美元罚款</title>
      <link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/08/06/technology/meta-new-mexico-child-safety.html</link>
      <description><![CDATA[陪审团发现 Meta 在其平台的安全性方面误导用户，并下令处以 3.75 亿美元的罚款，而该处罚是由州法官判处的。]]></description>
